Table sticky header background needs to cover.

Important: `.panel::before` inner border positioned absolute might overlay sticky table header? z-index? Panel::before is first child, no z-index, table header z-index 2. Fine. But pointer-events none.

Focus: `:focus-visible`. Buttons inside modal.

`body.modal-open` overflow hidden; on mobile viewport may jump. Fine.

